{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1010018-publishing-corebooks-in-different-formats","id":1010018,"title":"Publishing corebooks in different formats?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-29T18:05:01-08:00","id":1010018,"title":"Publishing corebooks in different formats?","content":"Are there any plans for publishing CoD books in formats besides PDF? ePUB and Mobipocket wouldn't take much time investment considering the job's halfway done with just having the book text lying around, and audiobooks in mp3/aac/what-have-you might find some market.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5236-lackey-man-ren","name":"Lackey Man Ren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T21:51:44-08:00","id":1010054,"title":"","content":"You could use an ebook managment program like calibre to convert PDFs into ebup and mobi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T00:55:16-08:00","id":1010095,"title":"","content":"Audiobook format would be...tricky. It'd effectively be lecturing the player on how to do something; the problem is that not only are the books huge, but they also have a lot of minutia that you often need to re-read to understand. This isn't taking into account the tables that all of them have, the examples, and that there would be difficulties in the many MANY sub-menues you'd need to somehow navigate with a much simpler interface. This is also not going into the troubles a simple accent would give others, as well as the unspoken pronounciations of certain terms (for example, Wyrd I've heard pronounced as both &quot;Weird&quot; and with a hard E instead of a Y). Plus, having someone simply read all that would be costly, time consuming, require proper facilities, editing all the clips together...audio stuff is hard work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T04:24:20-08:00","id":1010145,"title":"","content":"Also diagrams, like the spirit flowchart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}